          "name": "Value",
          "type": "ValueType&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "FSetElementId",
      "docs": "Add an entry to the cache.\nThe new entry must not exist in the cache,\nthere must be space within the LRU for the new entry.\nThe new entry will be marked as the most recently used one.\n@param Key The entry's lookup key.\n@param Value The entry's value.\n@return FSetElementId of the entry, update recent status without requiring a find operation.\n@see Empty, Find, GetKeys, Remove"
    },
